<title>EGYPT: Egypt says seeks 5,000-10,000T of fancy tallow.</title>
<headline>Egypt says seeks 5,000-10,000T of fancy tallow.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-08-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt's official Holding Company for Food Industries said on Sunday it was seeking 5,000 to 10,000 tonnes of extra fancy tallow for delivery in the first half of October.</p>
<p>Muharram Ghanem, head of the sales sector, told Reuters the deadline for bids was at noon (0900 GMT) on September 2.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
